  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">EVENTS</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<nav class=\"menu menu-sub-terms\" role=\"navigation\" id=\"menu-sub-terms\">\n\n\t\t\t<ul id=\"menu-sub-terms-items\" class=\"menu-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cat-item cat-item-5\"><a href=\"/archive/source-8323f775be51bfa1921f/\">ART IN THE PARK</a>\n</li>\n\t<li class=\"cat-item cat-item-72\"><a href=\"/archive/source-32cd4b4ee490840b3094/\">EN PLEIN AIR</a>\n</li>\n\t<li class=\"cat-item cat-item-41\"><a href=\"/archive/source-f25f8a22f42584a0f3e3/\">MONTHLY MEETINGS</a>\n</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t</nav>\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5755 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-art-in-the-park category-events category-news tag-art-in-the-park\" id=\"post-5755\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/sound-dunes-combo-to-entertain-at-the-guild-of-harwich-artists-art-in-the-park/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Sound Dunes Combo to Entertain at The Guild of Harwich Artists’ Art In The Park</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-05-05T08:10:40-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, May 5, 2021, 8:10 am\">May 5, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 8-piece Sound Dunes Swing Combo has been invited to entertain at this summer’s Art In The Park, hosted by The Guild of Harwich Artists. The combo will be performing <a href=\"/news/sound-dunes-combo-to-entertain-at-the-guild-of-harwich-artists-art-in-the-park/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5752 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-news category-zoom tag-larry-folding tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5752\">\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-demo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding Demo</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-dfd2582e14930d4b2c34/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Video</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-05-01T07:57:38-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, May 1, 2021, 7:57 am\">May 1, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5734\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6b9a0f8c5f6130988f7ec84e1e2c687ecfcbed898826363f24ba86889e0585.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Larry Folding gave a tour of his Harwich studio and a 1/2 hour watercolor demonstration at the April 24th General Meeting. View the meeting here using the access passcode <b>LarryFolding@421<br />\n</b></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Meeting Recording:<b><br />\n<a href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/share/MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJasLnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/<wbr></wbr>share/<wbr></wbr>MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-<wbr></wbr>1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJas<wbr></wbr>LnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca</a></b></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5762 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events\" id=\"post-5762\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/2021-plein-air-sessions/\" rel=\"bookmark\">2021 Plein Air Sessions</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-04-20T08:32:28-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 20, 2021, 8:32 am\">April 20, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Last season, the Guild’s weekly outside painting sessions allowed members to meet and paint while respecting social distancing.  We are surrounded by picturesque settings including waterfronts and harbors, wetlands, village <a href=\"/news/2021-plein-air-sessions/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5735 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-news tag-brian-powers tag-chatham-bars-inn tag-david-schofield tag-karen-marshall-shortsleeve tag-sedona-summer\" id=\"post-5735\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-members-exhibit-at-chatham-bars-inn/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"663\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a beach with waves and sand.\" src=\"/media/archive/285d9ed6e64f7d4f5fd8f7c1c6c3e4e96c99d217a828deb0f00df7ab9be8319f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-members-exhibit-at-chatham-bars-inn/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Members Exhibit at Chatham Bars Inn</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-24T18:44:52-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, March 24, 2021, 6:44 pm\">March 24, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists was recently featured at the Chatham Bars Inn ‘Meet the Artist’ Winter Art Series on Saturday, March 20, 2021. Paintings by seventeen Guild members were <a href=\"/news/guild-members-exhibit-at-chatham-bars-inn/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5700 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news\" id=\"post-5700\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/march-13-general-meeting/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"626\" height=\"382\" alt=\"Zoom logo on a white background.\" src=\"/media/archive/439fe2716b965db5e79002059170b51362c3c279fbf927e62b5b9e07a4347209.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/march-13-general-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">March 13 General Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-11T07:46:59-05:00\" title=\"Thursday, March 11, 2021, 7:46 am\">March 11, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ March General Meeting will be held this Saturday, March 13 from 2:00 – 4:00 p.m. via Zoom. We are meeting a week earlier this month <a href=\"/news/march-13-general-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5691 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-news tag-coa tag-harwich-community-center\" id=\"post-5691\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/seeking-spring-and-easter-themed-cards-for-coa/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"985\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A couple of envelopes with flowers on them.\" src=\"/media/archive/1b885a4b5b8dc3895bc973ccf180646b4eb6265df07af1c4afcb99eed8f4f451.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/seeking-spring-and-easter-themed-cards-for-coa/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Seeking Spring and Easter Themed Cards for COA</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-08T09:27:04-05:00\" title=\"Monday, March 8, 2021, 9:27 am\">March 8, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Valentine cards made by Guild members for the Harwich COA lunch program were well received. Harwich COA director Emily Mitchell shared with event coordinator Peggy Rose, “recipients love getting little extras <a href=\"/news/seeking-spring-and-easter-themed-cards-for-coa/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<span class=\"page-numbers dots\">…</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>16</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
